{"suttaId":"thag17.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[3599,3695],"vripara":"949"},"segments":{"thag17.1:0.4":"Phussattheragāthā","thag17.1:1.1":"Pāsādike bahū disvā, bhāvitatte susaṃvute;","thag17.1:1.3":"Isi paṇḍarasagotto [paṇḍarassa gotto (sī.)], apucchi phussasavhayaṃ.","thag17.1:2.1":"“Kiṃchandā kimadhippāyā, kimākappā bhavissare;","thag17.1:2.3":"Anāgatamhi kālamhi, taṃ me akkhāhi pucchito”.","thag17.1:3.1":"“Suṇohi vacanaṃ mayhaṃ, isipaṇḍarasavhaya;","thag17.1:3.3":"Sakkaccaṃ upadhārehi, ācikkhissāmyanāgataṃ.","thag17.1:4.1":"“Kodhanā upanāhī ca, makkhī thambhī saṭhā bahū;","thag17.1:4.3":"Ussukī nānāvādā ca, bhavissanti anāgate.","thag17.1:5.1":"“Aññātamānino dhamme, gambhīre tīragocarā;","thag17.1:5.3":"Lahukā agaru dhamme, aññamaññamagāravā.","thag17.1:6.1":"“Bahū ādīnavā loke, uppajjissantyanāgate;","thag17.1:6.3":"Sudesitaṃ imaṃ dhammaṃ, kilesessanti [kilesissanti (sī.), kilisissanti (syā. ka.)] dummatī.","thag17.1:7.1":"“Guṇahīnāpi saṅghamhi, voharantā visāradā;","thag17.1:7.3":"Balavanto bhavissanti, mukharā assutāvino.","thag17.1:8.1":"“Guṇavantopi saṅghamhi, voharantā yathātthato;","thag17.1:8.3":"Dubbalā te bhavissanti, hirīmanā anatthikā.","thag17.1:9.1":"“Rajataṃ jātarūpañca, khettaṃ vatthumajeḷakaṃ;","thag17.1:9.3":"Dāsidāsañca dummedhā, sādiyissantyanāgate.","thag17.1:10.1":"“Ujjhānasaññino bālā, sīlesu asamāhitā;","thag17.1:10.3":"Unnaḷā vicarissanti, kalahābhiratā magā.","thag17.1:11.1":"“Uddhatā ca bhavissanti, nīlacīvarapārutā;","thag17.1:11.3":"Kuhā thaddhā lapā siṅgī, carissantyariyā viya.","thag17.1:12.1":"“Telasaṇṭhehi kesehi, capalā añjanakkhikā;","thag17.1:12.3":"Rathiyāya gamissanti, dantavaṇṇikapārutā.","thag17.1:13.1":"“Ajegucchaṃ vimuttehi, surattaṃ arahaddhajaṃ;","thag17.1:13.3":"Jigucchissanti kāsāvaṃ, odātesu samucchitā [odāte susamucchitā (sī.)].","thag17.1:14.1":"“Lābhakāmā bhavissanti, kusītā hīnavīriyā;","thag17.1:14.3":"Kicchantā vanapatthāni, gāmantesu vasissare.","thag17.1:15.1":"“Ye ye lābhaṃ labhissanti, micchājīvaratā sadā;","thag17.1:15.3":"Te teva anusikkhantā, bhajissanti asaṃyatā.","thag17.1:16.1":"“Ye ye alābhino lābhaṃ, na te pujjā bhavissare;","thag17.1:16.3":"Supesalepi te dhīre, sevissanti na te tadā.","thag17.1:17.1":"“Milakkhurajanaṃ rattaṃ [pilakkharajanaṃ rattaṃ (?)], garahantā sakaṃ dhajaṃ;","thag17.1:17.3":"Titthiyānaṃ dhajaṃ keci, dhārissantyavadātakaṃ.","thag17.1:18.1":"“Agāravo ca kāsāve, tadā tesaṃ bhavissati;","thag17.1:18.3":"Paṭisaṅkhā ca kāsāve, bhikkhūnaṃ na bhavissati.","thag17.1:19.1":"“Abhibhūtassa dukkhena, sallaviddhassa ruppato;","thag17.1:19.3":"Paṭisaṅkhā mahāghorā, nāgassāsi acintiyā.","thag17.1:20.1":"“Chaddanto hi tadā disvā, surattaṃ arahaddhajaṃ;","thag17.1:20.3":"Tāvadeva bhaṇī gāthā, gajo atthopasaṃhitā”.","thag17.1:21.1":"[dha. pa.9; jā.1.2.141;1.16.122]“Anikkasāvo kāsāvaṃ, yo vatthaṃ paridhassati [paridahissati (sī. syā.)];","thag17.1:21.3":"Apeto damasaccena, na so kāsāvamarahati.","thag17.1:22.1":"“Yo ca vantakāsāvassa, sīlesu susamāhito;","thag17.1:22.3":"Upeto damasaccena, sa ve kāsāvamarahati.","thag17.1:23.1":"“Vipannasīlo dummedho, pākaṭo kāmakāriyo;","thag17.1:23.3":"Vibbhantacitto nissukko, na so kāsāvamarahati.","thag17.1:24.1":"“Yo ca sīlena sampanno, vītarāgo samāhito;","thag17.1:24.3":"Odātamanasaṅkappo, sa ve kāsāvamarahati.","thag17.1:25.1":"“Uddhato unnaḷo bālo, sīlaṃ yassa na vijjati;","thag17.1:25.3":"Odātakaṃ arahati, kāsāvaṃ kiṃ karissati.","thag17.1:26.1":"“Bhikkhū ca bhikkhuniyo ca, duṭṭhacittā anādarā;","thag17.1:26.3":"Tādīnaṃ mettacittānaṃ, niggaṇhissantyanāgate.","thag17.1:27.1":"“Sikkhāpentāpi therehi, bālā cīvaradhāraṇaṃ;","thag17.1:27.3":"Na suṇissanti dummedhā, pākaṭā kāmakāriyā.","thag17.1:28.1":"“Te tathā sikkhitā bālā, aññamaññaṃ agāravā;","thag17.1:28.3":"Nādiyissantupajjhāye, khaḷuṅko viya sārathiṃ.","thag17.1:29.1":"“Evaṃ anāgataddhānaṃ, paṭipatti bhavissati;","thag17.1:29.3":"Bhikkhūnaṃ bhikkhunīnañca, patte kālamhi pacchime.","thag17.1:30.1":"“Purā āgacchate etaṃ, anāgataṃ mahabbhayaṃ;","thag17.1:30.3":"Subbacā hotha sakhilā, aññamaññaṃ sagāravā.","thag17.1:31.1":"“Mettacittā kāruṇikā, hotha sīlesu saṃvutā;","thag17.1:31.3":"Āraddhavīriyā pahitattā, niccaṃ daḷhaparakkamā.","thag17.1:32.1":"“Pamādaṃ bhayato disvā, appamādañca khemato;","thag17.1:32.3":"Bhāvethaṭṭhaṅgikaṃ maggaṃ, phusantā amataṃ padan”ti.","thag17.1:32.5":"… Phusso thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
